# F.linear: the products of the rows of x and the rows of the weight, then the
# bias, as the convolution of a one-cell window. The rows of x are the
# positions and their inputs the channels of that convolution, so the cells of
# x are its input cells read at the exchanged index, and the cells of the
# result are its output cells read at the exchanged index.
